### 1. GET all books
GET http://localhost:5131/books


### 2. GET books filtered by author
GET http://localhost:5131/books?author=Tolkien


### 3. GET existing book by id
GET http://localhost:5131/books/1


### 4. GET missing book
GET http://localhost:5131/books/999


### 5. POST valid book
POST http://localhost:5131/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "The Hobbit",
  "author": "Tolkien",
  "price": 15
}


### 6. POST another valid book
POST http://localhost:5131/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "title": "1984",
  "author": "George Orwell",
  "price": 12
}


### 7. POST invalid book - empty title
POST http://localhost:5131/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "title": "",
  "author": "Someone",
  "price": 10
}


### 8. POST invalid book - negative price
POST http://localhost:5131/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 3,
  "title": "Invalid Book",
  "author": "Someone",
  "price": -5
}


### 9. PUT existing book
PUT http://localhost:5131/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "The Hobbit - Updated",
  "author": "Tolkien",
  "price": 20
}


### 10. PUT missing book
PUT http://localhost:5131/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Missing Book",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "price": 20
}


### 11. PATCH existing book price
PATCH http://localhost:5131/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 25
}


### 12. PATCH invalid negative price
PATCH http://localhost:5131/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": -10
}


### 13. PATCH missing book
PATCH http://localhost:5131/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 25
}


### 14. DELETE existing book
DELETE http://localhost:5131/books/1


### 15. DELETE missing book
DELETE http://localhost:5131/books/999


### 16. Check final list
GET http://localhost:5131/books